      "description": "Kling AI is a next-generation creative platform loved by creators around the world. Powered by the Kling foundation model, it provides powerful video and image generation and editing tools. Create freely, discover inspiration from other creators, and bring your ideas to life with ease.\n\nKey features of Kling AI:\n● AI Video: Turn text and images into stunning videos. Generate up to 15 seconds in native 1080p or cinema-grade 4K, then use Video Extension to create videos up to 3 minutes long.\n● AI Image: Generate images from text or existing images with native 4K ultra-HD output. Blend multiple reference inputs, create batch variations, and explore a wide range of aspect ratios and artistic styles. Turn static images into dynamic videos with a single click.\n● Community: Browse works from other users for inspiration, and collaborate with well-known AI creators to spark new ideas.\n● Clone & Try: Found your favorite image or video in the community? With a single click, you can clone the work and try out the amazing idea on your own.\n\nWhat creators are saying:\n● National TV director: \"Kling AI’s understanding and simulations of physics impressed me, and perfectly recreated the organic look of handheld shots from classic films.\"\n● Short film director: \"Kling AI excels in range of motion and visual aesthetics. It's shaping the future of AI creation.\"\n● Gaming studio lead artist: \"Kling AI’s prompt understanding and concept integration are exceptional. It’s the most versatile DiT video generation model, and has significantly reduced cost in my production.\"\n● Short video creator: \"Kling AI is higher in quality, more stable, and able to generate content with longer duration. My content created with Kling AI brings great traction and engagement, with one video reaching 900,000 views.\"\n\nThank you for choosing Kling AI. For any inquiries or support, please contact us at: support@klingai.com\n\nKlingAI Membership Service Terms\n\nIf you subscribe via Apple, payment will be charged to your App Store account upon purchase confirmation. The subscription will automatically renew unless auto-renewal is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current billing cycle. Renewal fees will be charged to your account within 24 hours prior to the end of the current cycle at the applicable rate. You can manage your subscription and auto-renewal settings in the “Settings” section of your device after completing the purchase.\n•    Service Agreement: https://ppg.kwai-pro.com/doodle/aDqchCbz.html        \n•    Payment Agreement: https://ppg.kwai-pro.com/doodle/CfSAxMJH.html        \n•    Privacy Policy: https://ppg.kwai-pro.com/doodle/hzUidQBb.html",
